{"title":"12 ft Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003cp\u003eIncorporating a 12' Artificial Christmas Tree into your holiday decor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStep into the grandeur of our 12-foot artificial Christmas trees collection at King of Christmas, where holiday enchantment meets majestic design. Each towering tree is a masterpiece, meticulously handmade and conveniently divided into hinged sections for easy setup and takedown. We even provide protective gloves, ensuring a hassle-free experience as you transform your space into a winter wonderland.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e12' Artificial Christmas Tree Colors \u0026amp; Styles\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoose from a rich array of colors, from the traditional rich green to the cool green, serene blue-green, or the timeless flocked green. Tailor your tree to match your vision – go for the warm glow of pre-lit branches or relish the opportunity to add your own lights with our unlit options. Explore the needle tip styles that suit your taste, be it classic, realistic, or a harmonious blend of both, adding an authentic touch to your holiday decor. With body styles ranging from full-bodied to slim and pencil, our collection ensures the perfect fit for every space and style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur 12' Artificial Christmas Tree Features\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo enhance convenience, each 12-foot tree comes with a storage bag for safekeeping during the off-season and a sturdy metal tree stand for a secure and elegant display. Elevate your holiday celebrations and bring the magic to larger spaces with our 12-foot artificial Christmas trees – the epitome of festive grandeur, only at King of Christmas!\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"12-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-unlit","title":"12' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642902704192,"sku":"KFS-T12-U","price":999.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/King-flock-slim.png?v=1655154264"},{"product_id":"12-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-led","title":"12' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 1250 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642903064640,"sku":"KFS-T12-L","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlockSlim_3b633f57-a093-4cad-ad9d-b9ee49c0cf07.jpg?v=1714673451"},{"product_id":"12-foot-king-douglas-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"12' King Douglas Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eInspired by the natural elegance of a real Douglas Fir, the King Douglas Fir features lifelike needles and a graceful, slender silhouette. Handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, Designed for realism and effortless upkeep, it fills your home with the spirit of the season and becomes a cherished centerpiece for holiday celebrations year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642934390848,"sku":"KDFS-T12-U","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-9_f60af6b2-0b65-4cc3-97b2-36de7d358615.jpg?v=1718158286"},{"product_id":"12-foot-king-douglas-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"12' King Douglas Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eInspired by the natural elegance of a real Douglas Fir, the King Douglas Fir features lifelike needles and a graceful, slender silhouette. Handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, Designed for realism and effortless upkeep, it fills your home with the spirit of the season and becomes a cherished centerpiece for holiday celebrations year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642934456384,"sku":"KDFS-T12-L","price":1299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingDouglasFirSlim_b6ee2028-b2be-4aa7-b263-477f086b3c1c.jpg?v=1783959840"},{"product_id":"12-foot-king-flock-tree-unlit","title":"12' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28982419423296,"sku":"KF-T12-U","price":1299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-tree_bf606b19-f46d-4ff9-856b-6b818aa90968.jpg?v=1718157885"},{"product_id":"12-foot-king-flock-tree-led","title":"12' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 1650 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28982419488832,"sku":"KF-T12-L","price":2499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlock_89f41dd8-9a44-41fb-8862-ab71fe91bba1.jpg?v=1714673353"},{"product_id":"12-foot-queen-flock-slim-tree-led","title":"12' Queen Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree With 1400 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":32364638765133,"sku":"QFS-T12-L","price":1799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlockSlim_037081ba-4227-46f2-b730-3258ae898b6d.jpg?v=1722012655"},{"product_id":"12-foot-alpine-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"12' Alpine Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eHandcrafted for lifelike realism, each branch mirrors the natural growth, color, and texture of a real Alpine Fir, native to the Washington state region. Enjoy festive charm without watering or needle cleanup, and bring the magic of a mountain-inspired Christmas into your home with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":40438550823112,"sku":"AFG-ST-12-U","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Alpinefirslim_be1c459a-73bf-4191-81a7-3cf2a425e6c7.jpg?v=1722887051"},{"product_id":"12-foot-alpine-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"12' Alpine Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree 1400 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eHandcrafted for lifelike realism, each branch mirrors the natural growth, color, and texture of a real Alpine Fir, native to the Washington state region. Enjoy festive charm without watering or needle cleanup, and bring the magic of a mountain-inspired Christmas into your home with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":41323781095624,"sku":"AFG-ST-12-L","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/AlpineFirSlimLED_a8e79fe7-6aab-4eaa-8691-c32c84f6d4f8.jpg?v=1723213414"},{"product_id":"12-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"12' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 1700 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":41331768525000,"sku":"QF-T12-L","price":2599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_54b948c2-bd38-4770-ab52-2249424db152.jpg?v=1722012618"},{"product_id":"12-foot-king-fraser-fir-tree-led","title":"12' King Fraser Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 3000 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the holiday season with the natural splendor of the Appalachian Mountains brought right into your home with the King Fraser Fir. Designed to mirror the majestic Fraser Fir, its lush foliage and classic conical shape really captures the authenticity of a real tree. Find the perfect size for your space and enjoy a holiday season full of lifelike charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":41393713021128,"sku":"KFF-T12-L","price":2899.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/King-Fraser-Fir-Full-v2_8e58e876-8680-47cf-87c7-5f183c358d8c.jpg?v=1718158350"},{"product_id":"12-foot-royal-fir-tree-led","title":"12' Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 2000 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":41393814733000,"sku":"RF-T12-L","price":2699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RoyalFir_aa79dce7-e173-4ad7-82e1-885f6a21f0e0.png?v=1722013226"},{"product_id":"12-foot-royal-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"12' Royal Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 1900 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":41400042258632,"sku":"RFS-T12-L","price":2199.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Royal-Fir-Slim-v2_072a2f0a-0d50-4f40-93b0-26d136f6f519.jpg?v=1722013075"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-trees_9e4939c6-07cc-42de-93fc-157bf5e468aa.jpg?v=1666795568","url":"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/12-foot-artificial-christmas-trees.oembed","provider":"King of Christmas","version":"1.0","type":"link"}